    "text": "9 hours ago Looking for something useful or fun without spending a dime? Here are a few free items currently available around League City — from home decor to exercise equipment and handy tools.\nRabbit Figurine A decorative rabbit figurine looking for a new home. It’s about 7 inches tall and 7 inches long . The tip of one ear is broken , but it could still make a cute addition to a shelf or garden display.\nLocation: Ellis Landing, League City, TX\nSource: nextdoor.com\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nNordic Track Rower A Nordic Track rowing machine , about a year old and lightly used. It shows an error code and needs a reset or minor repair. Perfect for someone handy who can fix it up. Free to anyone who can haul it away .\nLocation: League City, TX\nCondition: Used – like new (needs repair)\nSource: facebook.com\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace",
